WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:04.400
Mom, I want to talk to you about something.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.080
Mom- . Right now we have exciting things on the table.

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:10.800
A modeling contract most girls would only dream of.

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:13.180
Why won't you listen to me?

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:25.100
You think I wouldn't notice plane tickets- to Australia.

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.200
Even when your daughter is plastered on every magazine in New York,

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:30.920
it's like you still, can't see me.

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:33.960
Cora!

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.880
Oh my gosh, look at you!

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:38.700
What does you're mom think about you coming to stay?

00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:39.880
She thinks it's a great idea

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:45.820
So.  Cora this is Chicka, and this is Tom. How are you going?

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:49.040
C'mon

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:53.380
When's the last time you went swimming? In the ocean?

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:57.480
I missed most of my childhood,

00:00:57.560 --> 00:01:00.220
so I could be, where you wanted me.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.860
I fit in to your life,

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:04.200
and now

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:05.680
I'm doing something on my own terms.

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:08.220
Cora, you can't just always run away.

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:10.060
I am not running away.

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.820
I am running towards something else

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:18.880
Something on my own terms.

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:20.200
These are really good

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:21.180
Thank you.

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:23.100
Our family makes strong women,

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:24.560
and you're one of them.

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:26.560
Be proud of that.

00:01:36.940 --> 00:01:39.220
Open your eyes, and go Cora go

00:01:43.060 --> 00:01:45.000
Things happen,  they change.

00:01:45.515 --> 00:01:46.695
We can't control them

00:01:47.795 --> 00:01:50.365
What you can control, is how they change.

